you and keeping you alive.

00:25:05.070 --> 00:25:06.380
SHARON HARRIS: Without a doubt.

00:25:06.380 --> 00:25:09.180
We hope the information
that we shared today

00:25:09.180 --> 00:25:11.880
from the perspective of
a marketer, and retail,

00:25:11.880 --> 00:25:13.920
and of course the
technologist, have somehow

00:25:13.920 --> 00:25:15.600
been enlightening to you.

00:25:15.600 --> 00:25:17.550
I absolutely love technology.

00:25:17.550 --> 00:25:20.970
But what I love more is what
a technology allows me to do.

00:25:20.970 --> 00:25:24.210
I like it to be actually
seamless and in the background,

00:25:24.210 --> 00:25:26.910
because I want to be
the person in control.

00:25:26.910 --> 00:25:29.670
And for marketers, and
especially retailers,

00:25:29.670 --> 00:25:33.570
Google Cloud gives you
that speed, and privacy,

00:25:33.570 --> 00:25:35.970
and security to do what?

00:25:35.970 --> 00:25:38.760
Know your customer,
be your customer,

00:25:38.760 --> 00:25:41.110
empathize with your customer.

00:25:41.110 --> 00:25:43.590
Secondly, predict
marketing outcomes.

00:25:43.590 --> 00:25:45.395
You want to know where
the puck is going.

00:25:45.395 --> 00:25:46.770
You don't want to
be where it is.

00:25:46.770 --> 00:25:48.570
You want to be ahead
of those trends.

00:25:48.570 --> 00:25:50.460
And as a retailer
and a marketer,

00:25:50.460 --> 00:25:54.040
whatever your product is, you
need to have that ability.

00:25:54.040 --> 00:25:57.760
So you can harness the
technology to help you do that.

00:25:57.760 --> 00:26:00.930
And then thirdly,
personalized experiences.

00:26:00.930 --> 00:26:04.770
Consumers are demanding more
and more personalization.

00:26:04.770 --> 00:26:08.010
We want ads, products,
and experiences

00:26:08.010 --> 00:26:11.190
that are relevant to
us, that speak to us.

00:26:11.190 --> 00:26:12.670
That's really critical.

00:26:12.670 --> 00:26:14.580
So if you don't
take anything away

00:26:14.580 --> 00:26:16.320
from what we've
talked about today,

00:26:16.320 --> 00:26:17.940
take away these
three things when you

00:26:17.940 --> 00:26:20.190
think about the Google Cloud.

00:26:20.190 --> 00:26:23.310
Know your customer, predict
those marketing outcomes,

00:26:23.310 --> 00:26:25.740
and personalize
those experiences

00:26:25.740 --> 00:26:30.090
on a platform that gives
you greater speed, privacy,

00:26:30.090 --> 00:26:32.480
and security.

00:26:32.480 --> 00:26:37.990
Now, we've empowered all of
you with this great information

00:26:37.990 --> 00:26:41.240
so you can be change agents
in your organization.

00:26:41.240 --> 00:26:43.240
And that's not a difficult task.

00:26:43.240 --> 00:26:45.730
Change is always
hard, but it all

00:26:45.730 --> 00:26:48.240
begins with something
very simple.

00:26:48.240 --> 00:26:50.350
It's called the conversation.

00:26:50.350 --> 00:26:52.990
You know it's always like when
your significant other says,

00:26:52.990 --> 00:26:54.940
we need to talk.

00:26:54.940 --> 00:26:57.610
Let's have a talk
or a conversation.

00:26:57.610 --> 00:26:59.590
Those things can be challenging.

00:26:59.590 --> 00:27:03.370
But for an organization,
the biggest hurdle

00:27:03.370 --> 00:27:06.280
is really around
shifting mindset.

00:27:06.280 --> 00:27:08.740
Evolving the culture
of the organization

00:27:08.740 --> 00:27:11.550
can sometimes be your
number one obstacle.

00:27:11.550 --> 00:27:16.210
Having those conversations
early and often is really key,

00:27:16.210 --> 00:27:18.190
because you've really
got to work to break down

00:27:18.190 --> 00:27:22.810
the silos, in marketing,
in technology, in sales,

00:27:22.810 --> 00:27:26.590
in operations, and finance,
because ultimately,

00:27:26.590 --> 00:27:29.470
every single aspect
of the business

00:27:29.470 --> 00:27:32.810
is made better when
you come together.

00:27:32.810 --> 00:27:35.318
