00:31:14.637 --> 00:31:16.880
privacy and the
interests of customers

00:31:16.880 --> 00:31:20.540
in terms of having more privacy
or maybe control of their data

00:31:20.540 --> 00:31:23.212
and how that might affect
the marketing ecosystem.

00:31:23.212 --> 00:31:24.170
SHARON HARRIS: Oh sure.

00:31:24.170 --> 00:31:28.610
I mean, privacy is a hot topic.

00:31:28.610 --> 00:31:32.400
I think first and
foremost as a marketer,

00:31:32.400 --> 00:31:33.800
you need to understand consent.

00:31:33.800 --> 00:31:35.760
Consumer consent is everything.

00:31:35.760 --> 00:31:37.400
So if you're collecting
data, and it's

00:31:37.400 --> 00:31:39.660
important to have your
own first party data,

00:31:39.660 --> 00:31:42.380
make sure you have
the right consent.

00:31:42.380 --> 00:31:43.860
That's going to be key.

00:31:43.860 --> 00:31:46.520
And then, once again, it
needs to be first party data.

00:31:46.520 --> 00:31:49.628
We talk a lot about
data breaches.

00:31:49.628 --> 00:31:51.170
And a lot of that
stems from the fact

00:31:51.170 --> 00:31:53.240
that many marketers
and many brands

00:31:53.240 --> 00:31:55.050
don't really own their own data.

00:31:55.050 --> 00:31:56.690
They've got their data siloed.

00:31:56.690 --> 00:31:58.580
It's across different platforms.

00:31:58.580 --> 00:32:00.800
They've got different
agencies in there.

00:32:00.800 --> 00:32:03.410
So they don't really
have great visibility

00:32:03.410 --> 00:32:05.960
nor transparency into
what's happening.

00:32:05.960 --> 00:32:09.170
But there are a couple
of things that I really

00:32:09.170 --> 00:32:10.820
stress to people today.

00:32:10.820 --> 00:32:12.680
Pay attention to
the regulations.

00:32:12.680 --> 00:32:14.810
We already have GDPR in Europe.

00:32:14.810 --> 00:32:18.650
We have CCPA, or the California
Consumer Protection Act,

00:32:18.650 --> 00:32:20.720
that's about to
be ratified here.

00:32:20.720 --> 00:32:23.180
Those are really going to
be game changers for how

00:32:23.180 --> 00:32:26.520
you think about the collection
and storage of data.

00:32:26.520 --> 00:32:30.710
So first party data
is really critical.

00:32:30.710 --> 00:32:32.420
And because if
you don't have it,

00:32:32.420 --> 00:32:34.790
the penalties for
those data breaches

00:32:34.790 --> 00:32:37.110
are not just the loss
of your customers,

00:32:37.110 --> 00:32:38.680
but also some
pretty hefty fines.

